On a slightly different note, I must say I don't understand why so many people
are having trouble finding enough food.  Spoilers...

Perhaps you don't know that praying when you are weak from hunger will give you
food?  If you pray only when you are weak, you will never need food (assuming
you are not wearing any rings or amulets).  Of course, there is a small chance
that the gods will become angry if you pray that often, so I generally
suplement this by eating corpses.

By the time I find and identify rings I want to wear I generally have a lot of
food saved up and can kill large monsters, so food is still not a problem.

Also, abandoning your pet is a way to conserve edible corpses.

Hope this helps.
